<h1>Liubai - Technical Support</h1>
<p>Thank you for using <strong>Liubai</strong>! It's a self-discipline tool that helps you put down your phone and stay present. It doesn't nag you — it simply reminds you, softly, to bring your attention back to the moment.</p>

<h2>FAQ</h2>
<p><strong>1. How do I use the focus timer?</strong><br/>Pick a duration on the Focus tab and tap Start. During a session, put your phone down and focus on what matters.</p>
<p><strong>2. What is Deep Focus?</strong><br/>Turn it on and choose the apps you want to step away from. They'll be shielded during your session, so you can truly let go. On first use you'll be asked to authorize Screen Time — please allow it to take effect.</p>
<p><strong>3. How do I set a daily goal?</strong><br/>On the Challenge tab or in Settings (top-right), choose a daily focus goal from 1 to 4 hours. Complete it to check in.</p>
<p><strong>4. How do I manage or cancel my subscription?</strong><br/>Tap the subscription card in Settings, or go to iPhone Settings → your Apple ID → Subscriptions.</p>
<p><strong>5. What if Restore Purchases fails?</strong><br/>Make sure you're using the same Apple ID you used to purchase, then tap Restore Purchases on the subscription page.</p>

<h2>Contact Us</h2>
<p>If you run into any issues or have suggestions, please reach out via:</p>
<p><strong>Email:</strong> support@zhaoshaodan.com</p>
<p>We usually reply within 48 hours.</p>
<p>⚠️ Note: All data (focus records, challenges, settings) is stored locally on your device and is not backed up to the cloud. Uninstalling the app will permanently delete this data.</p>
<p>— The Liubai Team</p>
